{"step_index":1618,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T10:19:12Z","thinking":"The `client.extract.run` function returns a `JobAccepted` object because the extraction process is asynchronous. This means the extraction isn't immediately complete; it's a job that needs to be tracked. The `JobAccepted` object contains an ID that identifies this ongoing extraction job. This mirrors the asynchronous nature of the parse job as well.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import time\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom unstructured_transform_client import TransformClient\n\ntest_pdf = Path(r\"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy\\جملة العمروووو.pdf\")\napi_key = \"[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]\"\n\nschema = {\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n    \"title\": \"Supplier Product Names\",\n    \"description\": \"Extract product entries from all pages as source data only. Return one entry per source product row, preserving duplicates and different strengths. Include products even when price or quantity is blank or zero. Copy names faithfully without spelling repair or inferred digits. Do not infer stock, requested quantities or shortage matches.\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"Every product entry from every page, in document order. Keep repeated entries. Exclude document headers, footers, contact details, column labels and totals.\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                    \"item_name_raw\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"description\": \"Copy the complete product name/description exactly as present in the source, preserving Arabic, English, mixed text, spelling, strengths, units, dosage form, pack numbers, punctuation and manufacturer text. Do not correct, translate or complete it. Exclude values belonging to separate price, discount or quantity columns, but retain numbers written inside the name itself.\",\n                    },\n                    \"source_page\": {\n                        \"type\": [\"integer\", \"null\"],\n                        \"description\": \"The 1-based source page containing this product entry, taken from the source page metadata. Return null when unavailable; do not guess.\",\n                    },\n                },\n                \"required\": [\"item_name_raw\", \"source_page\"],\n                \"additionalProperties\": False,\n            },\n        },\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"items\"],\n    \"additionalProperties\": False,\n}\n\nprint(f\"[*] Starting Chained Parse + Extract on {test_pdf.name}...\")\nwith TransformClient(api_key=api_key, server_url=\"https://transform.unstructured.io\") as client:\n    # 1. Parse\n    print(\"1. Submitting Parse job...\")\n    accepted_parse = client.parse.run(input=str(test_pdf), wait_seconds=0)\n    parse_job_id = accepted_parse.id\n    print(f\"   -> Parse Job ID: {parse_job_id}\")\n\n    job = client.jobs.get(parse_job_id)\n    while any(s in str(getattr(job, \"status\", \"\")).lower() for s in (\"queued\", \"processing\")):\n        time.sleep(3)\n        job = client.jobs.get(parse_job_id)\n        print(f\"   -> Parse Status: {job.status}\")\n\n    parse_result_id = job.result.id\n    print(f\"[+] Parse completed! Result ID: {parse_result_id}\")\n\n    # 2. Extract\n    print(\"2. Running Extract with Schema...\")\n    accepted_extract = client.extract.run(parse_id=parse_result_id, schema=schema, wait_seconds=0)\n    print(f\"   -> Extract response type: {type(accepted_extract)}\")\n    extract_job_id = accepted_extract.id\n    print(f\"   -> Extract Job ID: {extract_job_id}\")\n\n    # 3. Poll Extract job until completed!\n    ext_job = client.jobs.get(extract_job_id)\n    while any(s in str(getattr(ext_job, \"status\", \"\")).lower() for s in (\"queued\", \"processing\")):\n        time.sleep(3)\n        ext_job = client.jobs.get(extract_job_id)\n        print(f\"   -> Extract Status: {ext_job.status}\")\n\n    print(f\"[+] Extract Job Completed! Details:\")\n    if hasattr(ext_job, \"model_dump\"):\n        data = ext_job.model_dump()\n    else:\n        data = dict(ext_job)\n\n    print(\"Data keys:\", data.keys())\n    for k, v in data.items():\n        print(f\"  Key: {k}, Type: {type(v)}, Preview: {str(v)[:150]}\")\n\n    # 4. Cleanup\n    client.jobs.delete(parse_job_id)\n    try:\n        client.jobs.delete(extract_job_id)\n    except:\n        pass\n    print(\"[+] Test jobs deleted. Clean!\")\n","Description":"Complete poll for extract job","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\test_official_chain.py","toolAction":"Write complete chain test","toolSummary":"Write complete chain test"}}]}
